<instruction name="VPOPCNT">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Return the Count of Number of Bits Set to 1 in BYTE/WORD/DWORD/QWORD</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1046300">
   <string>This instruction counts the number of bits set to one in each byte, word, dword or qword element of its source (e.g., zmm2 or memory) and places the results in the destination register (zmm1). This instruction supports memory fault suppression.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
